Salwar kameez, ironed, Papa-approved: maroon, navy, one sober green. A stack of medical PDFs printed at the Sassoon Road shop. A pad stash in the back corner behind the Robbins. The Samsung's charger. Nothing here is a surprise, which is the point of it.

<<hubreturn>>


